  "limitations": [
    "CPU-only timings exclude GPU upload/draw, ImGui, actual audio device and synchronous loading.",
    "Debug wrapper/scene -O2, engine/game -O0; Release engine/game -O3. Three paired runs, first 60 of 360 ticks discarded per world.",
    "Skinning remains CPU-side; unchanged scene geometry still uploads every frame.",
    "One variant per asset can miss for different scales or unsynchronized animation. No culling or gameplay throttling.",
    "Native Metal not retested; M2 and remaining playtest reports stay open."
  ],
